Error [jet.LibraryEffectParentInvalid]: The parents of `Trail` form a cycle through `Audit`
  --> tests/ui/effects/package_effect_parent_cycle_is_e0758.jet:8:17
    |
  8 |         parent: Audit
    |                 ^^^^^
 Why: A package effect is a kind of its parent, so following the parents must end at an open Prelude effect or at a package effect without one
 Fix: Remove `parent: Audit`, or name an effect that is no kind of `Trail`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0758
